{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.dili.2023a.q27.material.recovered", "text": "材料一：长津湖战役中，中国人民志愿军以钢铁意志和大无畏的战斗精神。征服了极端严寒天气，打退强劲之敌。此役，成为抗美援朝战争的拐点。长津湖位于朝鲜北部的盖马高原，是狼林山脉和赴战岭山脉之间的人工湖。长津湖夏季阳光充足，冬季则异常寒冷，最低温度达-40℃。这里的气温适宜啤酒花生长，啤酒花喜冷凉。多分布在光照充足的山地林缘及灌丛或河流两岸的湿地，四十多年前，当地开始在赴战岭山脉等地种植啤酒花，其产品质量上佳。材料二：图14为长津湖地区分层设色地形图。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《初中地理》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "988851e48f44e718b460ff3f6c62da39e97980292f46238e5352dc39b4343c68", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2139, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2363, "next_source_question_number": 28, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《初中地理》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 27, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "988851e48f44e718b460ff3f6c62da39e97980292f46238e5352dc39b4343c68"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.dili.2023a.q27"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.dili.s1.k04", "ntce.chuzhong.dili.s1.k05", "ntce.chuzhong.dili.s1.k06"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.311.r001"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.dili.2023a.q27"], "word_count": 224, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "dili", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《初中地理》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《初中地理》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "988851e48f44e718b460ff3f6c62da39e97980292f46238e5352dc39b4343c68", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2139, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2363, "next_source_question_number": 28, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《初中地理》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 27, "alignment_status": "pending